{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428430/extras/83ef79995a17b7e901ea8dec11cc61ad.avif?t=1764519832\" width=600 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Sea Heroes</strong> is the ultimate top-down roguelike set in a captivating underwater world! Choose from 4 unique heroes, each equipped with exclusive weapons. Brave the ocean depths as you face off against pirates and deadly sea creatures, from fierce sharks to adorable yet dangerous axolotls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stunning underwater biomes, collect weapons and upgrades, and fight to survive intense battles while uncovering the secrets of the deep. If you crave action, strategy, and a one-of-a-kind experience beneath the waves, <strong>Deep Sea Heroes</strong> will hook you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428430/extras/a8bcbd1eedad5abfab4742ba8452c649.avif?t=1764519832\" width=600 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your journey through <strong>Deep Sea Heroes</strong>, you'll unlock new underwater heroes, ranging from a swift and nimble lobster to a towering and deadly killer whale. Every death marks the start of a new opportunity: choose to revive with your current character or dive into a fresh adventure with a new hero. The choice is yours, but the challenge in the depths never ends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428430/extras/157df9e952c8f84f3946f98eb3fd82fe.poster.avif?t=1764519832\" width=1132 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428430/extras/157df9e952c8f84f3946f98eb3fd82fe.webm?t=1764519832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428430/extras/157df9e952c8f84f3946f98eb3fd82fe.mp4?t=1764519832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428430/extras/57ee28c4d09443d68a390237d778d13f.avif?t=1764519832\" width=600 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons for every taste and style!.</strong>\u00a0Discover the eccentric <strong>Octopus Merchant</strong> in the depths and explore his collection of unique weapons. From aquatic launchers to devastating harpoons, he has everything you need to survive and triumph in the most intense battles. Equipping yourself has never been this fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428430/extras/950087e809492ccf013d97c9a42b9178.poster.avif?t=1764519832\" width=1132 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428430/extras/950087e809492ccf013d97c9a42b9178.webm?t=1764519832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428430/extras/950087e809492ccf013d97c9a42b9178.mp4?t=1764519832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428430/extras/13421021323f5f4c38eebf1d9e984ddf.avif?t=1764519832\" width=600 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From colossal armored crabs to cursed pirates of the deep, the bosses of <strong>Deep Sea Heroes</strong> are epic challenges that will test every ounce of your skill. Dodge, attack, and defeat them in intense, strategic battles. Prove your worth and claim your place as the true hero of the seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428430/extras/1717fdcb94464bd3e0f6ec0440cc2800.poster.avif?t=1764519832\" width=1132 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428430/extras/1717fdcb94464bd3e0f6ec0440cc2800.webm?t=1764519832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428430/extras/1717fdcb94464bd3e0f6ec0440cc2800.mp4?t=1764519832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Unlock Whale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428430/9b6e0369f4bbfd36909fad3f9499b48b1de4dd99.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Crabby","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428430/d922ae76d9e2d7cd3180f222077d5df8e8dd36ea.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Shrimp","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428430/083f8699288f341186e779508dff673c5b656d03.jpg"},{"name":"Enemies? What Enemies?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428430/cd849e653d1f054fade2e5875dfb2a47443d9d2f.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Even Better","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428430/86e4781675eaf83eb977c26bbd890b89e55d7c45.jpg"},{"name":"Armed and Dangerous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428430/daab1085381f0bb342783af7cf9e0b445a94a015.jpg"},{"name":"Pinch Proof","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3428430/a38103c1394d1a67ec2adf86f88d600268c3653e.jpg"},{"name":"The Last Zap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/342843